# Everything here is either a credential or a record of real people. easyq-crm is a PUBLIC
# repository — treat an accidental commit of any of these as a leak, not a mistake.

# The session string IS the login. Anyone holding it is signed in as the account, with no code
# and no password prompt. It is not recoverable-by-reset like a password; revoke it from
# Telegram → Settings → Devices.
session.txt
*.session

# Who has been contacted, what they said, and who is still owed an answer.
state.json
state.json.tmp

node_modules/
.env
